# Code owners for pull-request review requests.
#
# The project is maintained by one person, so the default owner is the
# maintainer for everything. If a path ever needs a different reviewer,
# add a more specific pattern *below* this one: GitHub applies the last
# matching pattern in the file, so the catch-all stays first and the
# exceptions follow it.
#
# A pattern and its owners share one line. (rustaman's copy of this file
# puts them on two lines, which GitHub parses as a pattern with no owner
# followed by a pattern named "@lnorton89" — i.e. it requests no review at
# all. Strobe's is the working form.)
* @lnorton89
